    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_0RB1RB_0LC1RA_1LD0RB_1RA1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_0RB1RB_0LC1RA_1LD0RB_1RA1LC p j' E).
    + lia.
Qed.

